        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for lod_pool_new/lod_pool_del",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for lod_pool_new/lod_pool_del\n\nlod_pool_new() and lod_pool_del(), the pool-table create and remove\nentry points, had no direct test coverage: existing lod_pool_test\ncases only exercised them indirectly as setup/teardown for other\npool functions.\n\nAdd cases covering lod_pool_new()'s name-too-long (-ENAMETOOLONG)\nand duplicate-name (-EEXIST, leaving lod_pool_count unchanged)\nrejections, and lod_pool_del()'s successful removal (pool becomes\nunreachable via lod_pool_exists()) and removal of an unknown name\n(-ENOENT).\n\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [augment-code]\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ifb4d064dfcc1ebf15b89b7c9d21277156cd23b00\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
